  <Client>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9306b621eeae437439044a22699d6427, type: 2}
  <TextContent>k__BackingField: 'Unbelievable, my house is completly unrecognisable.
    All theses flowers... It is truly a sight to behold!

    You have made my wildest
    dreams come to reality!

    Now, all my babies are waiting for me. I must give
    them all my love now.

    And for you, that means jackpot. Use that money well
    little one.

    Farewell,'
